{
    "word": "pariah",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "c3f38f3e-edb4-3fca-bb4c-4c610b54f5db",
                "word": "pariah",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "afbfb5f3-3b35-427a-9e77-e63951073cc6",
                        "entry_id": "c3f38f3e-edb4-3fca-bb4c-4c610b54f5db",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "pariahs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7fb8e39f-a072-3ea4-8f28-ea8eaceb4dd1",
                        "entry_id": "c3f38f3e-edb4-3fca-bb4c-4c610b54f5db",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Synonym of outcast: A person despised and excluded by their family, community, or society, especially a member of the untouchable castes in Indian society."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "86ba56ca-37db-451f-b601-61fa69fc9eb8",
                                "sense_id": "7fb8e39f-a072-3ea4-8f28-ea8eaceb4dd1",
                                "text": "What is this smoking that it should be considered a crime? I believe in my heart that women are jealous of it, as of a rival. They speak of it as of some secret, awful vice that seizes upon a man, and makes him a Pariah from genteel society."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "86e0ca5a-5b5b-4429-bcf0-8016b2dc4f00",
                                "sense_id": "7fb8e39f-a072-3ea4-8f28-ea8eaceb4dd1",
                                "text": "I’m a pariah, outlawed from Time Lord society."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad771975-d037-4101-b08a-19c9e664f8c4",
                                "sense_id": "7fb8e39f-a072-3ea4-8f28-ea8eaceb4dd1",
                                "text": "[…] I went from being a much-feted author to a pariah, since one of the many problems of being trashed on the front page of the New York Times is that everyone is in the know."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "da89aa4b-9257-3d80-8ec0-24974a0c8444",
                        "entry_id": "c3f38f3e-edb4-3fca-bb4c-4c610b54f5db",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A similarly despised group of people or species of animal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9ee605c-d8f3-45dd-b598-368cdf83c75e",
                                "sense_id": "da89aa4b-9257-3d80-8ec0-24974a0c8444",
                                "text": "As ecological conditions became unfavorable for pig raising, there was no alternative function which could redeem its existence. The creature became not only useless, but worse than useless—harmful, a curse to touch or merely to see—a pariah animal."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ab014ec-9269-478a-a72c-42ebafd772b9",
                                "sense_id": "da89aa4b-9257-3d80-8ec0-24974a0c8444",
                                "text": "This scenario could lead to war crimes the scale of which has not been seen in Europe since the Nazis — crimes that would make Vladimir Putin, his cronies and Russia as a country all global pariahs."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4660e2e6-4dcf-3e86-a95b-952144c6cba7",
                        "entry_id": "c3f38f3e-edb4-3fca-bb4c-4c610b54f5db",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ellipsis of pariah dog (“an Indian breed, any stray dog in Indian contexts”)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "ellipsis"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e3dffa8d-4ce9-4c89-a55e-2eafeac8b536",
                        "source_entry_id": "c3f38f3e-edb4-3fca-bb4c-4c610b54f5db",
                        "source_sense_description": "member of the untouchable castes in Indian society",
                        "target_lang_word": "paria",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "paria",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9365fb95-2fad-3c1f-b1d4-135d764d1378",
                                        "entry_id": "4800a1ac-ca60-300f-b642-f121f9e0c814",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne de la dernière caste en Inde."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccac53fb-6df6-4cdc-8b14-a0c6f96e5dd6",
                                                "sense_id": "9365fb95-2fad-3c1f-b1d4-135d764d1378",
                                                "text": "La caste des parias est réputée infâme par toutes les autres."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a275a124-4483-3619-bc8c-de9bea553b55",
                                        "entry_id": "4800a1ac-ca60-300f-b642-f121f9e0c814",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Individu exclu d’un groupe social ou humain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d3a22ba-660a-4911-9e7b-e7ef56adf2d9",
                                                "sense_id": "a275a124-4483-3619-bc8c-de9bea553b55",
                                                "text": "Il est sur ce rivage une race flétrie,[…]\nLes parias ; le jour à regret les éclaire,\nLa terre sur son sein les porte avec colère."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d104f66e-7efe-4930-acb7-02ed8761d63e",
                                                "sense_id": "a275a124-4483-3619-bc8c-de9bea553b55",
                                                "text": "Après avoir, sous plusieurs formes, expliqué la nature et plaint la condition du Poète dans notre société, j’ai voulu montrer ici celle du Soldat, autre Paria moderne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbf5a0cc-2c0a-4b97-8e76-542e39ea2e19",
                                                "sense_id": "a275a124-4483-3619-bc8c-de9bea553b55",
                                                "text": "Pérégrinations d’une paria (1833-1834)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96f98abe-a555-4846-8234-77969da17dec",
                                                "sense_id": "a275a124-4483-3619-bc8c-de9bea553b55",
                                                "text": "Et, sans que Silvère eût besoin de les interroger, ses camarades lui racontèrent l’histoire du braconnier Chantegreil et de sa fille Miette, avec cette haine aveugle des foules contre les parias."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84796d4c-90dc-472f-9ee2-9c5d45d8739b",
                                                "sense_id": "a275a124-4483-3619-bc8c-de9bea553b55",
                                                "text": "En France, les grands patrons qui ne sont pas issus de la noblesse d’État sont des parias du monde des affaires."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "paria",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a61f5282-1d0c-36c4-a236-12779e67510c",
                                        "entry_id": "da142806-c9de-3970-bda7-a65539bb3d79",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Type de confiture de la Bresse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "paria",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "60d3d5f7-2ebd-3da9-847b-60605a06f270",
                                        "entry_id": "170f65c2-92f0-34c9-b38f-056c8f1e1e85",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Troisième personne du singulier du passé simple de parier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "756974d3-7cf8-41f4-93c4-1a53d4951b32",
                        "source_entry_id": "c3f38f3e-edb4-3fca-bb4c-4c610b54f5db",
                        "source_sense_description": "member of the untouchable castes in Indian society",
                        "target_lang_word": "Paria",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Paria",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7bbd1bf9-8707-34e9-82e0-40fd119737b3",
                                        "entry_id": "fff142a3-55ca-3028-9e13-b87580ee5f9a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die der niedrigsten oder gar keiner Kaste im indischen Kastensystem angehört"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2434f40e-26a2-4148-a81c-32c8fdfe1e4b",
                                                "sense_id": "7bbd1bf9-8707-34e9-82e0-40fd119737b3",
                                                "text": "„Die indischen Parias hingegen, über die nur Abstoßendes berichtet wird, eignen sich kaum für eine Erzählung über die Wiedergeburt eines Königsgeschlechts.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b261f30d-c4af-36c3-bf72-e90d88c20de1",
                                        "entry_id": "fff142a3-55ca-3028-9e13-b87580ee5f9a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die am Rande der Gesellschaft steht und unterprivilegiert ist"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "literary"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "671b855e-02b3-4ca2-85ea-d58e616ea416",
                                                "sense_id": "b261f30d-c4af-36c3-bf72-e90d88c20de1",
                                                "text": "„Unter etwa 80 Millionen Deutschen und Österreichern waren die Juden des Großdeutschen Reiches völlig abgesonderte Parias.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df796365-7bcb-46e6-8448-d941c3bb29e1",
                                                "sense_id": "b261f30d-c4af-36c3-bf72-e90d88c20de1",
                                                "text": "„Sie hatte schon früher versucht, ihn zu interviewen, und jedes Mal hatte er sie behandelt, als wäre sie eine Art Paria.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b038f013-81ca-43bd-9f44-8955206af0d4",
                                                "sense_id": "b261f30d-c4af-36c3-bf72-e90d88c20de1",
                                                "text": "„Insbesondere Douglas wird aufgrund seines ausländisch klingenden Vornamens gehänselt und schließlich sogar vom Lehrer öffentlich zum Paria erklärt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8074552d-b0fc-44fb-80a2-ea0c127ca283",
                                                "sense_id": "b261f30d-c4af-36c3-bf72-e90d88c20de1",
                                                "text": "„Vielleicht war die Fußballweltmeisterschaft das endgültige Signal, daß Deutschland den Status des Paria verloren hatte, für mich viel entscheidender aber war der Tag, an dem Kardinal Ratzinger zum Papst gewählt wurde.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8b29c28f-9a16-480a-a2a9-fdc63be1c007",
